flash_attn_tile<512,512,{2,8|4,4|8,2},false> spill=0                   (were 4 to 1039)
## oob=true variants of the same rows stay at 350 to 384; the small ncols rows (untouched) at 271 to 384.
## chosen for D=512: rows 32 and 16 -> (512,2,32,128). Wider nbatch_K helps at both D=256 and D=512,
## presumably because the K tile lives in shared memory and a wider tile shortens the unrolled inner loop.

